									<li><strong>Identifiant pérenne :</strong> <a href="https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/btv1b8495112n" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="meta-permalink">Gallica ark:/12148/btv1b8495112n</a></li>
